key for the unicorn's direction, I realize that there's also one space
behind the unicorn with some candles on it. But it's too late again.
Izchak gets angry, and I run away from him. Somehow I outmaneuver him
and lock him in an empty room. I assume he's got a key and can get
out, but AFAIK, he hasn't yet. Guards come after me, but I kill them
